{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/139693-htv-risking-willpower-question","id":139693,"title":"HTV risking willpower question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-16T13:21:58-07:00","id":139693,"title":"HTV risking willpower question","content":"on page 158 of mortal remains in the rules update in the 'risking willpower' section, it says that a successful willpower risk will allow a hunter to &quot;choose from two of the following advantages&quot;. does this mean I get two advantages from the list on the roll? (i.e. 9 again and + three dice) or am I reading it wrong?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2212-somebody-s-bad-guy","name":"Somebody's Bad Guy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T13:38:52-07:00","id":139737,"title":"","content":"Any roll on which you risk Willpower gets to pick two of the listed benefits, instead of the normal +3 dice from spending Willpower normally. Failing the roll expends the risked Willpower point and automatically yields a dramatic failure with two practical beats, while succeeding yields the normal results of success, plus a practical beat and a restored point of Willpower.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","val